ssuecomment-5454042295","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121451","id":5454042295,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRRYUtw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-28T14:53:56Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T14:53:56Z","body":"It doesn't help to spam the issue, so please do not, instead bring it up in the contributors' chat to see if someone can look into it","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5454042295/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5525942722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121451#issuecomment-5525942722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121451","id":5525942722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSV8xwg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T12:43:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T12:43:30Z","body":"Reproducible with MSVC only. It is an issue with upstream library, but `mbedtls` likely was never designed to be built in a cut down form it is with this config.\n\nCan be worked around with the following patch:\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/thirdparty/mbedtls/tf-psa-crypto/include/mbedtls/pk.h b/thirdparty/mbedtls/tf-psa-crypto/include/mbedtls/pk.h\nindex 3eb4dc2d26..de56242c11 100644\n--- a/thirdparty/mbedtls/tf-psa-crypto/include/mbedtls/pk.h\n+++ b/thirdparty/mbedtls/tf-psa-crypto/include/mbedtls/pk.h\n@@ -87,9 +87,9 @@ typedef struct mbedtls_pk_info_t mbedtls_pk_info_t;\n \n #define MBEDTLS_PK_MAX_RSA_PUBKEY_RAW_LEN \\\n     PSA_KEY_EXPORT_RSA_PUBLIC_KEY_MAX_SIZE(PSA_VENDOR_RSA_MAX_KEY_BITS)\n \n-#define MBEDTLS_PK_MAX_PUBKEY_RAW_LEN 0\n+#define MBEDTLS_PK_MAX_PUBKEY_RAW_LEN 1\n #if defined(PSA_WANT_KEY_TYPE_ECC_PUBLIC_KEY) && \\\n     MBEDTLS_PK_MAX_EC_PUBKEY_RAW_LEN > MBEDTLS_PK_MAX_PUBKEY_RAW_LEN\n #undef MBEDTLS_PK_MAX_PUBKEY_RAW_LEN\n #define MBEDTLS_PK_MAX_PUBKEY_RAW_LEN MBEDTLS_PK_MAX_EC_PUBKEY_RAW_LEN\n```","author_as